    "description": "A prescribed finite odd-class wake, non-axis drift and heading determine a computable period cutoff. Integer-clock and crossing-flow bounds cover diagonal drift; reciprocal exponential moments cover general non-axis drift. An exact finite-word realization criterion then yields terminating inverse synthesis with a constructive finite seed.",
